== 4. Remark 5.4a: (1-2x)(1+e) >= 1+e-4x for e in [0,1], x in [0,1/2]; e_d <= beta_n <= 1
  (1-2x)(1+e) - (1+e-4x) = -2*x*(e - 1)   (= 2x(1-e) >= 0 for e <= 1)
== 5. paragraph after Cor 5.4: general-c PAC-Bayes extra terms; Lambda_N/n
  residual: 0 ; Lambda_N/n = N**gamma/(2*c)
  at c=n^(1-theta): N^g/c = N**gamma*n**(theta - 1) (c=1 <=> theta=1)
