== 9. Cor 5.3 'range of d': c_d <= c_d (d n_d)^{1/H}; ln(1/a_d) <= (d/3) ln 2
  (d n)^{1/H} >= 1 for d,n >= 1: trivially; a_d = (max{c,1}/2^d)^{1/3} >= 2^{-d/3}
== 10. Remark 2.9(d): B' = max{B,1}/tanh 1 >= 1, constant unit tanh(1) is a fixed point of u -> tanh(u/tanh 1 * tanh 1)
  1/tanh(1) = 1.3130; tanh((1/tanh 1)*tanh 1) = 0.761594 = tanh 1 = 0.761594
